# AI Acoustic Signal Training Platform - Cursor Rules

## Project Overview

This is a local AI training playground application focused on **acoustic signal processing** machine learning, providing a visual interface for audio data analysis, model building, training, and evaluation.

## Tech Stack

| Category | Technology |
|----------|------------|
| Language | Python 3.10+ |
| GUI Framework | PyQt6 (Catppuccin dark theme) |
| Deep Learning | TensorFlow 2.15+ / Keras 3.0+ |
| Audio Processing | librosa, soundfile, scipy, pydub, sounddevice |
| Visualization | pyqtgraph, matplotlib |

